<title>USA: Food Lion says to buy Kash n' Karry for $341 million.</title>
<headline>Food Lion says to buy Kash n' Karry for $341 million.</headline>
<dateline>SALISBURY, N.C.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Lion Inc. said Thursday it agreed to buy Florida-based supermarket chain Kash n' Karry in a deal valued at $341 million.</p>
<p>Salisbury, N.C.-based Food Lion, one of the nation's largest supermarket chains, said under the deal Kash n' Karry shareholders will receive $26 a share in cash, and Food Lion will also refinance $221 million of Kash n' Karry's existing long-term debt.</p>
</text>
